    "regime_notes": "Selective gate active on 290 dates (6.70% of available dates); daily IC by chronological thirds was 0.056664, 0.009783, and unavailable in the final partial segment because no late gate observations occurred. Interpret uncertainty conservatively given 15-instrument cross-section.",
